      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a very evocative way of putting it. When you speak of \"bringing order\" and managing the \"unpleasantness,\" could you elaborate on what you mean by that? Specifically, how would you describe the native character or temperament that necessitates such a \"firm hand\"?",
